      "source": "Reading Converter factory for Enums. This differs from the one provided in org.springframework.core.convert.support\nby getting the result from the jackson objectmapper (which will process @JsonValue annotations) This is registered in\n<a href=\"../../config/AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.html#customConversions(com.couchbase.client.core.encryption.CryptoManager,com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper)\"><code>AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.customConversions(CryptoManager, ObjectMapper)</code></a>.\nThis will take precedence over <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/IntegerToEnumConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>IntegerToEnumConverterFactory</code></a>",
      "translation": "Enums 的 ReadingConverter 工厂。与 org.springframework.core.convert.support 中提供的那个不同，它从 Jackson ObjectMapper 获取结果（该对象映射器会处理 @JsonValue 注解）。此转换器在 <a href=\"../../config/AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.html#customConversions(com.couchbase.client.core.encryption.CryptoManager,com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper)\"><code>AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.customConversions(CryptoManager, ObjectMapper)</code></a> 中注册。它将优先于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/IntegerToEnumConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>IntegerToEnumConverterFactory</code></a> 生效。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html#getConverter(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\">getConverter</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\">ConverterFactory</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Integer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Integer</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Enum.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Enum</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\">ConverterFactory</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Integer.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">Integer</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Enum.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">Enum</a>&gt;</code> 中的 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterFactory.html#getConverter(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\">getConverter</a></code>",
